---
interface Props {
  detailed?: boolean;
}
const { detailed = false } = Astro.props;
---

<div class="service-path-grid">
  <article id="colony-removal" class="service-path-card">
    <div class="service-path-topline">
      <p class="eyebrow">Homes &amp; properties</p>
      <span aria-hidden="true">01</span>
    </div>
    <p class="service-path-status">Planned / Assessment first</p>
    <h3>Colony removal</h3>
    <p>
      Every setting is different. Identification, colony location, and safe
      access would be the starting points for deciding whether work is within
      scope.
    </p>
    {detailed ? (
      <>
        <details class="service-path-details">
          <summary>What an assessment would consider</summary>
          <ul>
            <li>The setting and where bees have been noticed.</li>
            <li>
              Access, site conditions, and whether a structure is involved.
            </li>
            <li>
              Whether swarm collection, removal, or another response is
              appropriate and within confirmed capability.
            </li>
            <li>
              Any structural work or repairs, which are not included or promised
              here.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </details>
        <a class="text-link service-path-link" href="/#connect">
          Find our contact channels <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
        </a>
      </>
    ) : (
      <a class="text-link service-path-link" href="/services#colony-removal">
        Explore colony removal <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
      </a>
    )}
  </article>
  <article id="farm-pollination" class="service-path-card">
    <div class="service-path-topline">
      <p class="eyebrow">Farms &amp; growers</p>
      <span aria-hidden="true">02</span>
    </div>
    <p class="service-path-status">Planned / Assessment first</p>
    <h3>Farm pollination</h3>
    <p>
      A future conversation about the crop, the bloom, and the setting. Any plan
      would depend on hive capacity, site access, and an agreed approach to
      care.
    </p>
    {detailed ? (
      <>
        <details class="service-path-details">
          <summary>What a conversation would cover</summary>
          <ul>
            <li>The crop, acreage, and anticipated bloom window.</li>
            <li>Site access, placement, and relevant crop-care practices.</li>
            <li>Actual hive capacity and timing before any agreement.</li>
            <li>
              Responsibilities and a care plan. No hive supply, date, or crop
              result is guaranteed.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </details>
        <a class="text-link service-path-link" href="/#connect">
          Find our contact channels <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
        </a>
      </>
    ) : (
      <a class="text-link service-path-link" href="/services#farm-pollination">
        Explore farm pollination <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
      </a>
    )}
  </article>
</div>
<p class="fine-print service-path-safety">
  <strong>Give bees space.</strong> Do not disturb a colony or approach it for a
  photograph. These are planned services, not emergency assistance; online
  booking is not offered.
</p>

<style>
  .service-path-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }
  .service-path-card {
    display: flex;
    min-width: 0;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: start;
    padding: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.5rem);
    border: 1px solid var(--forest);
    background: var(--paper);
    scroll-margin-top: 2rem;
  }
  .service-path-topline {
    display: flex;
    width: 100%;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.5rem 1rem;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding-bottom: 1.25rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .service-path-topline > span {
    font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-style: italic;
    line-height: 1;
  }
  .service-path-status {
    margin-top: 1.75rem;
    color: var(--tomato);
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.07em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .service-path-card h3 {
    margin-block: 0.75rem 1.15rem;
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 3vw, 2.75rem);
    line-height: 1.1;
  }
  .service-path-card > p:not(.service-path-status) {
    max-width: 31rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.9;
  }
  .service-path-link {
    margin-top: auto;
  }
  .service-path-details {
    width: 100%;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    border-block: 1px solid var(--line);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }
  .service-path-details summary {
    min-height: 3rem;
    padding-block: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.6;
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  .service-path-details summary:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 0.2em;
  }
  .service-path-details summary:focus-visible {
    outline: 3px solid var(--forest);
    outline-offset: 4px;
  }
  .service-path-details ul {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.65rem;
    padding: 0 0 1.25rem 1.25rem;
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }
  .service-path-safety {
    max-width: 57rem;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    padding-left: 1rem;
    border-left: 2px solid var(--tomato);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
  }
  @media (max-width: 46rem) {
    .service-path-grid {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    }
    .service-path-card {
      padding: 1.5rem;
    }
  }
</style>
